# Config pane server — all of these are optional; sane defaults apply.
PORT=4310
HOST=127.0.0.1
# Set to require Basic auth for everything except /api/fork/* (see PUBLIC_PATHS in server.ts).
# ALSO required (independently of PUBLIC_PATHS) for the admin-panel/proxy routes —
# /api/fork/games, /api/fork/schedule, /api/fork/game/:id/*, /api/fork/message — which
# refuse with 503 if this is unset, rather than defaulting open like the rest of the API.
# Those routes expose real admin power (close/delete/concede a live game, broadcast a
# message) and must not ride on the historical "open on localhost dev" default, especially
# with this host bound 0.0.0.0 and testers actively connected.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
PACKAGES_DIR=
VALIDATED_CSV=

# FUMBBL40k fork DB — needed for /api/fork/register (coach registration),
# /api/fork/coaches (opponent autocomplete), and the matchmaking routes. Also, when set,
# /api/fork/challenge requires the caller's fork password and verifies it against
# ffb_coaches before a challenge counts toward mutual consent — without this, "mutual
# consent" is spoofable (anyone could issue both sides of a challenge under someone
# else's name and trigger a real admin `schedule`). Leave FORK_DB_HOST unset to disable
# (open, dev-mode); matches the Discord bot's own FORK_DB_* (same fork/DB).
FORK_DB_HOST=
FORK_DB_PORT=3316
FORK_DB_USER=ffb
FORK_DB_PASSWORD=ffb
FORK_DB_NAME=ffblive

# Fork teams dir — needed for /api/fork/library/ingest (writes team XML there). Same
# path the Discord bot uses (fumbbl40k-server\ffb-server\teams). Unset ⇒ ingest 503s.
FORK_TEAMS_DIR=
# Where per-coach team-library JSON files live. Defaults to config-web's data-store/library.
FORK_LIBRARY_DIR=

# Fork's HTTP admin API (AdminServlet) — used by /api/fork/challenge to schedule a real
# game server-side (an authoritative gameId) instead of relying solely on a shared
# gameName. Optional: leave FORK_ADMIN_PASSWORD unset to skip this and fall back to the
# original gameName-only pairing (still works, just less direct).
# Value = the fork's server-dev.ini "admin.password" — already an MD5 hex, NOT cleartext.
FORK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:<FORK_GAME_PORT or 22227> — the admin API shares the game
# WebSocket's port. Override only if the fork's admin API is reachable elsewhere.
FORK_ADMIN_URL=
FORK_GAME_PORT=
